<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-024" chapter-id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu" source-id="s-nanshi-024-wangsu-ws1765279">
  <p id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0000" ref="x90_vgz_2uf_AAAA">素</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0002" ref="x90_vgz_2uf_AAAA">休業</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0005" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDB">彬</persName>五世孫而<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0010" ref="pwq_tuu_wns">逡之</persName>族子也。高祖<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0018" ref="x90_vgz_2uf">翹之</persName>，晉光祿大夫。曾祖<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0029" ref="x90_vgz_2uf_A">望之</persName>、祖<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0033" ref="x90_vgz_2uf_AA">泰之</persName>，並不仕。父<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0041" ref="x90_vgz_2uf_AAA">元弘</persName>，位平固令。<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0049" ref="x90_vgz_2uf_AAAA">素</persName>少有志行，家貧<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0057" ref="916_z0f_u2a">母</persName>老，隱居不仕。宋孝建、大明、泰始中，屢征不就，聲譽甚高。山中有蚿聲清長，聽之使人不厭，而其形甚醜，<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangsu:p001:m0107" ref="x90_vgz_2uf_AAAA">素</persName>乃爲蚿賦以自況。卒年五十四。</p>
</text>
